# Animation Philosophy

Use Framer Motion for animations.

Animations should:
- improve UX
- feel smooth
- remain subtle
- avoid blocking interaction

Avoid:
- excessive parallax
- heavy GSAP usage
- scroll-jacking
- flashy motion

Performance is more important than visual effects.

